00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:25.060
There she goes.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.080
What's the meaning of this?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.560
for wade barnett i do that pair just dropped barnett and made a clean getaway all right get back to

