00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:22.370
Pull off the road.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.080
Look and see if your father's men are following us.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.220
Looks like he made a getaway.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.100
Judging from the gas along the road, they can't get much farther.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.050
Keep going.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.550
Oh, the gas tank's smashed.

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.150
You have on the vanishing ray.

