You can escape.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:17.450
They're father's men.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:18.070
They won't hurt me.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:19.410
Then they'll make you a prisoner again.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:20.280
Oh, wait.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.200
