00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:29.970
Get this on with...

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:30.660
quickly as you can.

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:37.180
All right.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:40.200
Now stand by the car, let them seal, then duck into the bushes.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:43.000
When you're out of sight, press these three buttons, and then you'll disappear.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.380
Now, do you understand exactly what you have to do?

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:47.620
Yes, I do. Hurry, please.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:49.240
All right. I'll be waiting down the road.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.440
Gone she couldn't be. We were just two jumps behind her.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:33.690
I don't like this, Tarkin.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.130
There's some devilry going on.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.470
People don't disappear.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:37.610
Don't be a fool, Ken.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.610
She's somewhere around here.

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:39.350
We'll find her.

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:53.060
You watch the car, Badger.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:53.500
Hope.

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:57.590
Step on it.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.340
What happened?

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:00.980
Where's the car?

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:01.740
What'd you shoot at?

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:03.720
The car just went by itself.

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:04.810
Nobody in it.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.480
You're either drunk or crazy, Badger.

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:07.570
All right.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.770
Whatever's in that car was the same thing that cracked you in the jaw.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.090
Well, we won't talk about it.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:14.790
We'll borrow a car from that road gang down there.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:15.490
Come on.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:30.580
Stanley?

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.050
Professor Van Dorn's cabin.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:46.900
Van Dorn?

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.440
He won't let me in.

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:51.470
He thinks I'm aiding father in his attempt to get your tribune start.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:53.560
Well, you'll be in before he knows it.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.620
Change seats with me and use the vanishing rain.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:05.420
Thank you.

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:16.290
It's an electrical key.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:17.440
Watch the gate.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:10.360
I'm glad.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:11.200
See you back safe.

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:12.240
I'm filled.

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:14.370
Where'd you get the car?

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:16.240
Well, Mr. Barnett's about it.

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:16.800
What do you think of it?

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:18.930
I had to take it they put yours out of commission.

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:20.550
Well, I'll send back for it.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:21.870
And the girl.

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:24.440
found that she is working with those men?

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:27.280
On the contrary, I found that she's everything that I...

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.500
That she is working with her father, Barnett.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:29.820
Oh, no.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:30.820
as I said.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:32.880
The vanishing wave.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:34.060
Somebody has stolen it.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:34.660
Wait, Gloria.

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:44.030
Gloria.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:46.670
A break, please.

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:48.350
I don't intend to be insulted.

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:49.190
Don't go like that.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.450
The professor didn't mean all that.

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:51.570
And on.

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:56.090
Vlad, I'm sorry, but there's nothing in the world I fear as much as women.

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:58.040
You have no reason to fear me, Professor.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.080
I'm not dangerous.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:10:59.900
all

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.120
women are dangerous. But they're not all treacherous.

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:03.590
Perhaps you're right.

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.090
And since Stanfield vouches for you,

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:07.720
Won't you accept my apologies?

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:09.370
Come inside, please.

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:41.440
Cadwell, we've got to get hold of either Stanfield's or McDonald's Tribune stock somehow.

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:44.410
They have enough voting stock to control the coming board meeting.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:47.040
refuses to consider any offer for his stock

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.080
until he's seen Stanfield and has

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.660
his consent. We've got to prevent their meeting.

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:57.000
Well, what now? Have you located Stanfield?

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.160
Taking the girl from the pines and gone.

00:11:59.420 --> 00:11:59.680
Oh!

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:01.920
The four of you guarding the house?

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:02.680
I don't know how.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:03.820
Some sort of black magic.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:04.660
Black magic rot.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.100
This isn't the Middle Ages.

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:07.220
It's the 20th century.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:08.800
All right, listen to what happened.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:12.060
I think I'd better meet McDonald.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:16.760
Arranged to pull his stock with mine in order to get control of the paper.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.420
I can make the appointment for you.

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:20.460
Mr. McDonald, you know, is my boss.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:21.160
Well, that's fine.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.160
While you're doing that, I'll take the stock into some safe place in town.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.720
The vault in my city office is impenetrable.

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:29.610
Nobody could open that.

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:31.510
Unless...

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:32.630
Unless what?

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:38.450
Unless he happened to possess this little device.

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:40.980
What is that?

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.320
I'll show you by demonstration.

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:53.930
It's all.

00:12:59.350 --> 00:12:59.970
We've only to...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.660
Increase its power and rain?

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:02.460
By George, yes.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.320
It had cut a hole in the side of a battleship.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:07.850
Well, bring it along, Professor.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:09.510
If you don't mind, I'd like to look it over.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.330
You can't valiby your bungling that way.

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:17.410
Go out and get Stanfield.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.920
Getting Stanfield isn't going to be easy.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.090
We could get the girl again.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:25.070
All right, but remember, she is not to be harmed.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.150
Set a watch on her house.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:28.560
She may lead you to Stanfield.

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:29.830
I'll get on right away.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.390
Yes, Gloria Grant speaking.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.810
Give me the editor, Mr. McDonald's line, please.

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:53.750
McDonald speaking.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.020
Hello, Miss Grant.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:59.820
You can tell Stanfield I'll pool my stock with his.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.160
And help him carry on his father's fight.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.690
Oh, that's fine, Mr. McDonald.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:05.410
I'm going now to see Mr. Stanfield.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:07.090
And I'll let you know where he can meet you.

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:08.000
Goodbye.

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:08.860
All right.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.660
Van Dorn's Electric and Laboratory, 9th and Water Street.

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.600
He just got in a taxi and started to town.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.270
Well, what are you waiting for?

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:19.870
them here.

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:50.160
Wait a minute. Step in there now.

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:54.550
The door closes and turns on a chemical ray that destroys the oxygen in the air.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:58.930
The vault being airtight, chemical ray burning.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.600
and Trudor could live there only a few moments.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.000
Professor, you worry too much about intruders.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:05.520
Thank you.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:05.960
Wait a minute.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:08.360
safe now.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:09.220
You sure?

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:09.740
Yes.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:11.660
Then I'm going to put my Tribune chairs away.

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:21.630
put them in that cabinet on the left.

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:29.980
60 cents, please.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.490
Thank you.

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:45.800
Keep the engine running.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:49.030
I have an idea that she's led us to Stanfield.

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:50.590
All right.

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:59.900
Then touch this button.

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.220
And my vault again becomes a trap for intruders.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:11.760
Donald Stanley.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.520
He agreed to pull his stock with yours so you may retain control of the tribune.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:16.650
Well, that's great, Gloria.

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:17.630
Then we've nothing to fear.

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:18.790
I'll call MacDonald at once.

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:30.930
Bye-bye.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:36.990
door, Ninth and Water Street. Come quickly.

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:45.190
Here's a call.

